<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">Hosea</book>
  <para style="h">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="mt">Hosea</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda gam a leengte Uzzia, Jotham Ahaz leh Hezekiah ten vai ahawm lai uleh Joash tapa Jeroboam in Israel gam leeng vai ahawm lai a, Beeri tapa Hosea kunga Mangpa thu hing tung khu tami ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Hosea kam manga thu agen pat laiin, Mangpa’n Hosea kungah, “Gam in Mangpa taisan a, kizuana thupitah abawltaah ziehin, Pei inlen kizua mite tate lah a, kizua mi khat zi in va neiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n ava pei a, Diblaim tanu Gomer azi dingin alata hi, tualeh amanu agai a, Hosea adingin tapa khat anei piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Hosea kungah, “Amin dingin Jezreel hisah in, aziehpen tomkhat zou chiengin, Jehu innkuonte tungah, Jezreel sisan phuba kala pai ding hi, tualeh Israel innkuonte leenggam ka beisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Jezreel phaijang ah Israel thalpi ka tansah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Gomer agai kia a, tanu khat anei hi. Tuachi’n Pasian in Hosea kungah, “Israel innkuonte ka lainat nawnlou ding ziehin, na tanu min dingin Lo Ruhamah na hisah ding ahi. Aziehpen Israel innkuonte ka khotuo nawn sih ding a, hinanleh ka sumang kilkel ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahivang in Juda innkuonte tungah lainat ka nei ding a, Mangpa a Pasian un amauh ka hundam ding hi, thalpite, namsaute, kidounate leh sakolte leh sakol tungtuong mite in amaute ka hundam sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gomer in Lo-Ruhamah nawineh akhawlsah zouin agai kia a, tapa khat anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in: “Amin dingin Lo-Ammi hisah in, aziehpen nou ka mite na hisih ua, tualeh kei zong na Pasian uh ka hisih ding hi achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel tate tamdan pen koima te senglou leh koima simsenglou, tuipi pieu a senel bang ahi ding ua, “Noute, ka mite hisih uteh” kichina mun ah, “Noute, Pasian hing tate nahi uh,” akung uah chi ahita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin Juda mite leh Israel mite akigawmkhawm kia dinga, tualeh amaun lamkai khat akiguot ding ua, khum gam apat in ahing peitou ding uhi, Jezreel ni khu thupi ding ahiziehin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na sanggampate uh kungah Ammi chi unlen, na sanggamnute uh kungah Ruhamah, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na nu genpi unlen, ngawh un, amanu ka zi ahisih a, Kei zong apasal ka hisih hi! Amaitang apat akizuanate leh, anawite gel kikaal apat in, a angkawmnate koimang heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahisihleh apuonsilte ka hawhkhe dinga, guohtang in ka umsah dinga, gamdai bangin ka bawl dinga, gamgaw bangin ka koi ding a, dangta in ka thatlia kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Atate ka khotuo sih ding hi, kizua tate ahi ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen anu uh akizua a, amaute painu in zumhuoi tahin abawlta hi. Amanu’n, Ka tanghou leh ka tui, ka samul leh ka puonnem, Ka sathau leh ka dawn ding hing pie, ka itte nuazui ding ka hi, achi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin ngai in, na lampite lingin ka khabing dinga, bang ka bawlkhum ding a, apeinate amu thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama itte anuadel dinga, hinanleh adelpha sih ding hi; Ahi amauh asui dinga, hinanleh amu sih ding hi. Tuachi’n ama’n ka pasal masa kungah ka nua peikia ding hi, aziehpen tua khu Kei a dingin tu a sangin ahoizaw hi, achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen a manu’n bute, uoin thate leh sathaute, ka pie a, tualeh Baal a dinga abawl uh dangka leh sanate ka suhpung pieh lam athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka kinuale kia dinga, ka bute alah hun laitah chiengin ka lamang ding a, ka uoin thate alah hun chiengin ka lamang dinga, tualeh asaguoh khuna samulpuon leh puonmalngat ka nualah pieh kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin amanu itte mitmu in azamaw ka dawhsah ding a, Koima’n ka khut apat ahunkhe zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aguolnopnate zousie, apawite, ahathate, akhawlnite leh a annzaluina thupitahte ka sutawp nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh a grepguite leh atheipi kungte, ka suhsiet pieh ding hi; Aman: Tamte kei hing itte apat a ka kipahman ahi, achite khu, Ken tuate gammang lah ka suohsah dinga, gamsaten ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Baal pasiente abieh ua, akung ua gimnamtuite ahal lai nite u’zieh a amaute gawt ding ka hi. Amanu bilba leh suongmantamte a kizem a, amanu itte nuadel in, Kei ahing manghilta hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuaziehin ngai in, ama ka zawl dinga, gamdai ah ka puilut ding a, akungah lungmuonhuoi tah in thu kagen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khuna kipat in a grephuonte ama ka pe dinga, tualeh Akor phaijang kinepna kotpi ka suohsah ding a, khunah akhangdawn lai bangin la asa ding a, Izipt gam a kipat a ahing pawtdoh lai nite bangin la asa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tualeh tua ni chiengin tambang ahi dinga, nouten kei khu Ishi na hing chi ding uh a, Baali na hing chi nawn sih ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kam apat in Baalte minte ka lamang ding a, Tualeh aminte ua theizing in aum nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Gamlah a gamsate toh, tunga leeng vate toh, ganhing leitunga bohvahte toh, thuhun ama ua dingin, ka bawlpieh ding a, thalpite, namsaute, kidounate, leitung apat in ka subei ding a, amaute galmuong tahin ka lumsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumtawn a kei a dingin, ka hing khamta dinga, Ahi, dihtatna leh thudih a vaihawmna toh itna muonhuoi leh, khotuona in ka hing khaam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ginumna toh keima dingin, ka hing khaam ding a, tualeh Mangpa na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin tambang ahing hi ding a: Keima’n ka dawng ding a, Keima’n vante ka dawng ding a, amaun leitung a dawng ding uhi; Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leitungin bu leh uoin tha, tualeh sathau toh a dawng dinga, Amaun Jezreel adawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama pen Kei a dingin lei ah haichi bangin ka tu dinga, khotuona mu ngailounu, ka khotuo dinga, Tuachi’n Ka mi hiloute kungah, ka mite na hi uh chi vangin, amaun ka Pasian na hi, ahing chi ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Pei kia inlen, numei midang toh kingai lai, angkawmnu va it in; Israel taten pasien dangte lam a kihei in, grep ga gaw tanghoute ngaina nan uleh, Mangpa’n a it zing mabangin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Keima a dingin amanu dangka shekel sawm leh nga leh barli bu homer khat leh homer kimkhat in ka leita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ken amanu kungah, “Ka kungah ni tampi na umden ding a, na kizua nawn sih dinga, pasal koima dang zi na hi sih dinga, tuamabangin Kei zong nanga ka hi ding hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Israel tate a dingin leeng ahisihleh vaihawm umnonsihvan, kithoina ahisihleh milim khuomte umnonsihvan, siempu puonah ahisihleh teraphim umnonsihvan, ni tampi tambangin a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuazou chiengin Israel tate ahing kinuale kia ding ua, Mangpa a Pasian u’leh, David aleengpa uh asui ding ua, tualeh ni nukhia lamte ah Mangpa leh ahoina zau kawm in ahing zuon ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou Israel tate aw, Mangpa thu ngaiun, Aziehpen gam sunga tengte tungah, Mangpa’n ngawhna ahing tun ding hi, gam sungah thutah a um nawn sih a, gin umna leh hepina a um nawn sih a, Pasian theina mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kichiemna leh zuougenna, tuolthana, guhtatna leh angkawmna bawlin, sisan, suona ngenin apum dim siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin gam in asuun dinga; tualeh khuna tengte zousie, gamsate leh tunga leeng vate, aba gawp siengta ding ua, tuipi a um ngate zong lahmang in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahivang in koima kihau sih henlen, koima khat leh khat kiphawh sih u’heh, na mite pen siempu kihaupite bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin suntang laiin na kipalpua dinga, guolneipa zong zanlai in nang toh apua ding a; Tualeh na nu ka sumangthai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite theina atahsap zieh un, suhmangthai in a um uhi. Theina na nuol ziehun, Ken zong ka siempu na hina uapat in, ka hing nuol ding hi. Na Pasian dan na manghiltah ziehin, Ken zong na tate ka manghil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hing pun tam deudeu u’leh, ka tungah akhiel tam deudeu uhi; athupina uh zumnain ka heng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mite khelna kivahnain anei ua, alungtang uh athulimlouna uah anga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahi ding: Mipite leh siempute akibang ahi ding ua, agamtatnate uh ziehin amauh ka gawt dinga, asilbawlte uh ka thuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ane ding ua, atai tuom sih ding uhi; aziehpen amaun Mangpa thumanna atawpsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kizuana, zu leh zu tha in lungtang sal in ataangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka miten asing milimte uh kungah thu adong ua, tualeh achieng un atheisah zel uhi. Aziehpen akizuana lungsimte un amauh apielmangsah a, a Pasian uh nuasie in akizuata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Muol tungte ah kithoina alan ua, muolvumte, gangpi singte, begaw singte leh hiengzau sing, lim nuomtah nuoite ah gimnamtui ahal uhi. Tuaziehin na tanute uh akizua uh a, na moute un angkawm na abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tanute uh akizua chiengun, ka gawt sih dinga, na moute un ang akawm chieng un zong, amaute ka gawt sih ding hi; aziehpen pasalte nangawn zong, kizuate toh atuom in apei ua maitam ah kizuate toh, kithoina alan khawm uhi. Tuaziehin mipi atheisiemloute, akipal pua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang Israel kizua nanlachin zong, Juda vang kizuana ah puasih heh, Gilgal ah hawsih unlen, Beth-Aven ah zong pei sih unlen, “Mangpa ahin a ahin pouleh,” chiin, kihahsiel in kichiem sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen Israelte bawngla genha bang ahi ua, Tuin gam lientah ah Mangpa’n amaute, belamnou bangin agamta sahta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ephraim in milimte toh akizopta, a um umin na umta heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zu dawn uh atawp chiengun, kizua bangin agamta nalai lai uhi, avaihawmte un, zumhuoina gamtatte a it nalai kenkon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hui in amanu ahate in atun a, tualeh akithoina ziehun azum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siempute aw tami zaun, Israel innkuonte aw, ngaisah un, Lengpa innkuonte aw, bildaw un, Mizpah a ding a thang na hizieh u’leh, Tabor muol a lenthang kizah na hizieh un, thukhenna na tung uah tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei amaute zousie phawhhiltu na hinanleng zong, mihelte khu mithana ah akihal thuh mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraim ka thei a, Israel khu, keima lah ah phuol ahisih hi. Tu’n vang Ephraim aw, nangman kizuana na bawltah ziehin, Israel abuata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A Pasian uh lam a kihei kia dingin, asilbawlte uh a tawpsan sih ua, alah uah kizuana lungsim a um a, tualeh Mangpa athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel kiletsahna in amaitang ah atheisah a, tuaziehin Israel leh, Ephraim athulimlouna uah akipalpua ding ua, Juda zong amautoh akipalpua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa sui dingin agan honte u’leh, abelam honte utoh akuon ding ua, hinanleh amusih ding uhi, alah ua pat in akihemkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa tungah lepchie tahin agamta ua, aziehpen namdang zawlta anei uhi. A hathate un amaute leh agoutante uh, ane bei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeah ah belamtal ki mut unlen, Ramah ah pengkul mut un, Beth-Aven ah ngaitah in kikou unlen, Benjamin aw na nualang en in, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phawhna ni atun chiengin, Ephraim asegawp ding a. Ken atung ngeingei ding silte, Israel namte lah ah ka theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda miliente gamgi suondohte bang ahi ua; atung uah ka thangpaina tui bangin, ka sungbaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim in mihing thupieh kilawp tah a azui ziehin, thukhenna ah suhgenthei leh kisegawp in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuazieh in Ephraim a dingin nget bang ka hi a, Tualeh Juda innkuonte a dingin, muotna bang ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ephraim in anatna a mu a, Juda in aliemna amu tahin, Ephraim Assiriate kungah ahaw a, Lengpa Jareb kungah a sawlta hi; hinanleh ahing sudam thei sih a, na liemnate zong adamsah thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Ephraim a dingin humpibahnei, bang ka hi ding a, Juda innkuonte a ding in humpibahnei, hatlai bang ka hi ding hi. Kei, Keima ngelngel in ka bottel dinga, ka peimangsan ding a, Amaute ka pomang dinga, koiman amauh ahunkhe sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A khelna uh kiphawh a, ka mel asui masangsie uh, Ka umna ah ka kia san ding hi; agimthuohna uah kei pilvang tahin ahing sui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hing pei un, Mangpa kungah kinuale kia vai, Aman ahing bottelta a, hinanleh ahing sudam ding hi. Aman ahing liemsahta a, hinanleh ahing tuom pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni ni nua chiengin aman ang suhal ding a; a ni thum ni in Aman ahing kaithou ding a; Amasangah i hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasian thei vai, Mangpa theina del zel vai. Zingmawng nisuoh akikhellou bangin, Ama apawtdohna suhdet ahi. Ama ikungah guozu bangin ahing pei dinga, Guo masa leh guo nukhia leitung buohnom bang in,” ahing pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Ephraim bang hing law ding kata diei? Aw Juda bang ka hing law ding adiei? Na muonhuoina uh zingmawng meilum bang ahi a, Zingmawng daitui bangin, amang pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin guolneite zangin amaute ka heukhie a, ka kam a thute in amaute ka thatta a; tualeh vaihawmnate khovah bangin ataangkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen ken kithoina hilou in khotuona ka dei a, Tualeh halmang kithoina sangin, Pasian theina ka lunggul zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Adam bangin thuhun apalsan ua, tuachi’n lepchie tahin ka tungah agamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead khu silgilou bawlte khopi ahi a, sisan a buasah in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh suomhat pawl in mi adapbuh bangun, siempu honten Sekem lampi ah mi athat ua, sil zumhuoi abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel innkuonte lah ah sil chizat huoi ka muta hi. Khunah Ephraim akizua a, Israel abuata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mipi saltaangte ka puikia chiengin, Aw Juda nanga ding in zong bu lah ding, ka hing guotpiehta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel damsah ka tup chiengin, Ephraim thulimlouna leh, Samaria gitlouna akilangdoh zel hi. Amauten zuouthu agen ua, asung lam ah guta alut a, apulam ah suomhat hon in ana suom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Agitlouna zousie uh ka theizing ahi chi, alungtang un angaituo ngai sih uhi; tuin vang asilbawlte un amauh aimkimkotta a, ka masangah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Agitlouna un leengpa akipahsah ua, azuou gen un a miliente uh akipahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A bawnpi un angkawm ngen ahi ua, tanghou kangmiin tol in ajelsuoh masangsie a, tangbuong amehman zieh a mei sawn atawpsan, lungthu kisulum bang, ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I leengpa ni chiengin, miliente zu chia dawn in akham ding ua, Aman misimmawhatte toh akhut azah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi adapbuh lai un alungtang uh, lungthukhua a mei-am sa bangin abawlzouta ua, alungthahna uh zankhuo in adai a, zingmawng in mei bangin akuongdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A unpi un lungthukhua bangin asa ua, vaihawmte uh anetum uhi, aleengte zousie uh apua ua, alah uah koima kei hing han a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim lah namdangte toh akigopta a, Ephraim khu tanghou kan khulelou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamdang miten athahatna anehkhawng piehta ua, hinanleh aman athei sih hi, Ahi, asatunga amulte akaang siengta a, hinanleh aman athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel akiletsahna in amai ah aheeh a, hinanleh Mangpa a Pasian uh kungah, akinuale kia sih ua, tamte zousie zieh in Ama asui tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim khu vakhu lungmawl, lunggel theilou ahi nalai a, Izipt ahan a, Assiriate kungah ahaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Apeinachinteng uah, ka len ka zah khum dinga, tungleeng vate bangin ka kaikhesuh ding hi; akhawmpite un azahsa mabangin, amaute ka phawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atung uh agih hi, Kei apat a ataimang ziehun! Amaute adingin sietna ahi. Ka tunga atatkhel ziehun! Amaute tankhe nanleng zong, Keima kal in zuou agen nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amauten alungtang tahtah un, Kei ahing han nuom sih ua, alupna tungte uah kap leh mau in aum uhi. Bu leh zu tha a dingin akikhawm ua, ka tungah ahel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima mama in amaute chiil in, abantha uh hatsah nanleng zong, ka tungah silhoilou abawlsawm nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nuakia ua, hinanleh Tungnung Sang Pen kungah ahisih hi; thalpi lepchie bang ahi ua, alei ua samsietnate ziehin amiliente uh, namsau in apua ding uhi. Tamte Izipt gam a, nuisat a aumna ding uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na kam leh pengkul sutuo in, Ka thuhunte abotsie ua, ka danthupieh ahelsan ziehun, Ama muvanlai bangin, Mangpa innkuonte dou dingin ahing pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israelte Kei lam ah akikou ding ua, Ka Pasian uh, Nang ka hing thei uhi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel in silhoi apaimangta a, melma in ama anuadel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lengte atungdoh ua, hinanleh kei bawl hilou in, miliente abawldoh ua, Ken ka theikha sih hi. Kei apat satkhieh a a umna dingun, adangka uleh sanate un milim abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Samaria, na bawngnou milim nuol ahita, Ka lungthahna atung uah akuong hi. Mawna bei a ahing umna ding uh, bangtan vei hiding adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen bawngnou milim Israelte akipat ahi a, akhutsiemte un abawl ua, tuazieh in Pasian ahi sih hi. Hinanleh Samaria bawngnou milimte, akeh in akise gawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hui atu ua, pingpei a at uhi. Bukung in vui anei sih a, bu vui in neh ding apieng sah sih ding a, piengsah tamananleh gamdang miten anebei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel nawmval in a umta a, tuin um leh bel deihuoilou bangin Jentelte lah ah a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Assiria gam a peitou gam sabiltung tangtat bang ahi uhi. Ephraim in alawmngaite a guoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi, namte lah ah kiguoitama nan u’leh, tu in ken amaute ka khawm dinga, tualeh miliente leengpa puohgih ziehin, hun tomkhat lunggimna athuoh zuol ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim in khelna dinga maitam tampi abawl ziehin, maitamte khu ama a dingin khelna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaute a dingin ka danpieh thupite ka gielta a, Hinanleh tuate khu sildang khat bang giapin angaisut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei a dinga kithoina sillat in, sa alan ua, akineh zel uhi; hinanleh Mangpa’n tuate apom sih hi. Tuin Aman athulimlouna uh athei ngitnget dinga, akhelnate uh agawt dinga, Izipt gam ah anuakia kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel in ama siempa amanghilta a, bieh innte alam hi; Juda in zong kulpi nei khopite a pungsah hi. Hinanleh keiman a khopite tungah, mei ka sawl dinga aleeng innpite uh mei in akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel midangte bangin kipahin nuom sin, Aziehpen na Pasian kalin kizua in na umta hi. Na buphuol tung teng ah kizuana man na lunggul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bu vuoh na phuol leh grep suhna khuh in, amauh avah sih dinga, uain tha akitasam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa gam ah ateng sih ding ua, hinanleh Ephraim Izipt gam ah akinuale kia dinga, Assiria gam ah sil sienglou ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa kungah uoin sillat alansih ding ua, Ama adingin asillatte uh lungkimhuoi ahi sih ding hi. Ama ua dingin mishi suunte tanghou bang ahi ding a, ane zousie abua ding ua, aziehpen ahinna ua dingin atanghoute uh, Mangpa inn ah alut sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni tan guottuom ni in bang na bawl ta diei, tualeh Mangpa annkuonglui niin bang na bawl ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai in, sietna ziehin apei ua, Izipt in amauh akhawm dinga, Memphis in amauh avui ding hi, a dangka koina munte uh lahkhai in apoukhum dinga, apuonbuh sungte uah loulingnei apou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gawtna nite ahing tungta a, thuhkiana nite ahing tung hi, Israel in athei ding hi! Guolneipa khu mi mo a ngai ahi a, Hagau mi zong mi mo a ngai ahi. Aziehpen na khelna uh athupi seng a, na kihuotna uh athupi seng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim galvengpa Ka Pasian toh a umkhawm a, hinanleh guolnei khu alampi tengah vathang kampa thang ahi a, Pasian inn ah kigal bawlna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibeah nite a bangin nasatah in akisuse gawpta ua, Aman athulimlounate uh athei ngitnget dinga, akhelnate uah agawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamdai a grep bangin Israel ka mu a, ahun a ga, theipi gamasa bangin na pu leh pate uh ka mu hi. Hinanleh Baal-peor langah apeita ua, zumhuoi dingin akituom koita uhi. Asil lunggulte uh bangin, amaute akidahhuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim thupina va bangin aleengmang dinga, nau pieng lou dinga, gai umlou ding a, naupai zong umlou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tate khoi lien nan u’leh, Ken a maute ka suunsah sieng dinga, atawp dongin pasal khat zong ka umsah sih ding hi. Ahi, amaute ka peisan chiengin, atung uh agih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tai-ar ka mu bangin, Ephraim khu mun nuomtah a suon ahi a, hinanleh Ephraim in tuolthat mite kungah, atate uh ahing puidoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Mangpa amauh pie in: bang ahiei na pieh ding? Nau pai theilou naubu leh, nawitui kang nawite pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A gitlouna uh Gilgal ah a um a, khunah amauh ka mudata hi. Asilbawl giloute zieh un, ka inn apat amauh ka notdoh dinga, amaute ka it nawn sih ding hi; a miliente zousie uh mihelte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ephraim vuoh in a um a, a thahuite agaw a, ga asuong sih ding uhi. Ahi, tate nei nan u’leh, gil aga ta deihuoite ka that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thu amanlou zieh un, Ka Pasian in amaute apaimang ding a, tuachi’n namte lah ah vahvai ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel pen grep ga nuomtah, ama a dinga kiga bang ahi a, aga tam dungzui in maitam apungsah deu deu hi. Agam hoina dungzuiin, milim suong kikhuoh kilawm tahtah aphut zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Alungtang uh akikhen a, Tuin mawtansah in a um uhi. Ama’n amaitamte achimsah dinga, amilim suong khente uh, asuse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuin amaun, Mangpa igiinlou zieh un, “Leengpa inei sih uhi. Tua leengpa’n ei a dingin bang ahiei abawl ding?” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuhun bawl a zuou a kichiem in thute agen uhi. Tuabangin lou kaizousa lai a namtul hing poudoh bangin, thukhenna apoudoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria a tengte khu, Beth-Aven bawngnou milim ziehin azau ding uhi. Mipiten bawngnou milim asuun ding ua, akipahpi siempute’n, akaa ding uhi, aziehpen athupina in apawtsan taah zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua milim khu Assiria leengpa Jareb kunga, silpieh dingin akipo dinga, Ephraim in zalatna amu ding a, tualeh Israel in ama lemguotna ah amaizum law ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samaria ahileh, aleengpa tui tunga kilam chiengkang bangin, sattan ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel khelna Aven mun sangte zong suhsiet ahi ding hi. Amaitamte uh tungah ling leh loulingneite apou ding a; tualeh amaun taangte kungah hing khukhum un, muolte kungah hing netkhum un, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Israel Gibeah nite akipat in nana khielta hi; khunah na ding ua. Thulimlouna tate tunga Gibeah a kidouna in, amauh a nuaphah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amauh ka phawh ut chiengin ka phawhhil ding hi. Tualeh abawsietna uh thuo nite zieh a, phawhhil ahi hun chiengun, amauh dou dingin mipite ahing kikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim pen bawngla chiilsiemsa ahi a, bu chil nuomtah ahi; Hinanleh keiman angawng kilawm tah ah, Ngawngkol ka posah ding a, lou ka kaisah ding. Juda in lei akal dinga Jakob in leitangte asunen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dihtatna chi tu unlen, Khotuona at unlen; na leikhalte uh satnen un, Mangpa sui hun ahita hi, Ama ahing pei a, na tung ua dihtatna guo ahing, zuhsah masangsie Ama sui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gitlouna na kai ua, Thulimlouna na at uhi. Na zuouthu gen ga na ne ua, aziehpen nouma gamtatnate leh, na mihat tampite uh na muong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuazieh in na mite lah ah, buoina ahing piengdoh dinga, Shalman in kidouna ni a, Beth-Arbel asuhsiet bangin, Na kulpite zousie susiet ahi ding a, Nu in atate tuolsena’n anei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Bethel na gitlouna alet seng tah zieh in, tuabangin na tungah bawl ahi ding hi. Zingmawng phalvah chiengin, Israel leengpa huoisetah a sattan in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel naungeh ahilai in Kana itta hi. Izipt gam a kipat ka tapa ka handoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaute a hat bangun tuachi’n, amaute apat in apei ua; Baalte kungah kithoina alan ua, milim siemthute kungah gimnamtui ahal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima’n Ephraim aban ua kai in pei ka kizilsah a, hinanleh amauh ka sudamta chi athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing khaujen nemtah, itna khau in amauh ka kai a; Kei khu ama ua dingin, angawng ua hahkol sutkhete bang ka hi a. Ka kunsuh a amauh ka vah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izipt gam ah akinuale kia sih dinga; hinanleh Assiria khu aleengpa ahi ding, akisia utlou ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A khopite uah namsau aleeng dinga, akulpi kot kalnate uh asuse ding a, akatum ding hi, amaute mama lemguotna zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mite kei apat nuatol dingin akumsuh ta ua, Tungnung sanga umpa han nan u’leh, Koiman Ama atawisang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim, bangchin ka hing tawpsan thei diei? Israel aw, bangchi’n ka hing pekhe thei diei? Bangchi’n Admah bangin ka hing bawl thei diei? Bangchi’n Zeboiim bangin nang ka hing koi thei diei? Ka sungah ka lungtang akikhule a, ka hing lainatnate akitohthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka lungthahna zauhuoi ka suohkhe sah sih ding a, Ephraim ka suse nawn sih ding hi. Aziehpen Kei Pasian ka hia, Mihing ka hisih hi. Na lah ua um a Siengthoupa ka hi a, zauhuoina toh ka hing pei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaun Mangpa nua azui ding ua, tualeh Ama ahawh chiengin, humpibahnei bangin ahawh dinga, tuachi’n atate tumlam a kipat in, chitun kawm in ahing pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izipt gam akipat in va banga, chitun kawm in ahing pei ding ua, Assiria gama pat vakhu bangin, ahing pei ding ua, Tualeh ken amaute a inn uah ka tengsah ding hi; Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephraim in zuouthu in ahing imkuol a, tualeh Israel innkuonte’n zehemna in ahing imkuol uhi; Hinanleh Juda in Pasian azui nalai a, A Siengthoupa lah ah a ginum nalai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephriam hui in akivah a, tualeh suolam hui anuadel hi, ni chin in zuouthu leh, thagum suona akhangsah semsem uhi. Assiriate toh zong thuhun abawl ua, Izipt gam ah sathau akipolut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Juda zong akinielpi a, Jakob agamtat dan dungzui in agawt ding hi; a silbawl dungzui in athuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Naubu a aumlai in asanggampa ketul atu a, ahatna zal in Pasian abuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi, ama’n vansawlsieng abuon a, azouta hi; akap a Ama apat deisahna angen a, Bethel ah Ama amuta a, tualeh khum mun ah Ama’n i kungah thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khu galkapte Mangpa Pasian ahi a, Mangpa chi khu Ama theizingna min ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tuachi’n nangpen na Pasian kungah kihei inlen, hepina leh dihna a vaihawmna tudet inlen; na Pasian ngah ngitnget in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kanaanmi lepchiete bangin Israel in, akhut ah buhna dihlou atawi a, suhgenthei a utlam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Ephraim in, “Ka hing hausata a, Keima a dingin hausatna ka muta” ka sepgimna zousie ah keima ah, thulimlouna khelna bangma amu sih ding uh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh kei khu Izipt gam a kipat a, Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi a, pawi kiguottuom nite lai bangin, puonbuhte ah ka hing tengsah kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ken guolneite zangin zong thu kana genta a, mengmunate ka tamsah sem sem a, Guolneite theipina mangin chiemtenate ka peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead ah milimte umnanleh, amaute bangmalou ahi uh. Gilgal ah bawngtalte lan nan u’leh, Ahi, amaitamte uh loukaina a suong, kisievumte bang ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siria gam ah Jakob ataimang a, Israel in zi ding thalaw in na asem a, zi ding thalaw in belamte aching hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa’n guolnei zangin, Izipt gam apat in Israel apuidoh a, tualeh guolnei zangin Israel avengbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ephraim in nasatahin alungthah sah a, tuaziehin asisan mawna, Mangpa’n ama tung ah anga ding a, tualeh agensietna u’khu amauh tungah, akinuale sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephriam in thu agen chieng, mite achitun ua, Israelte lah ah ama leh ama akitawisang hi; Hinanleh Baal biehna khelna a apua bep in, ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin akhiel semsem ua, a dangka siate un milimte asunthu ua, amauh siem dan dungzui a bawlthu ahia; Tamte zousie abawn in khutsiemte khutsuoh ngen ahia; Kithoina lan zousie in bawngnou limte tawp uhen, achi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute zingmawng tuimei bang leh, zingmawng daitui matah a mangkia bangmai, buphuol a bushi hui in amutmang bang leh, meikhulawng a pat meikhu pawt leengmang bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Keipen, Izipt gam akipat a Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi a, Kei loungal Pasian dang na neitheilou ding uh, aziehpen Kei loungal Hundampa dang a umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamdai gamgaw nasatah muna hing kempa khu Keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaute ann a ka vah chiengin atai ua, atai chieng un alungtang uh akisathei a, tuazieh in amaun Kei ang manghilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama ua dingin humpibahnei bang ka hi ding a, kamkei bangin lampi gei lah ah amaute ka buh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vompi anoute kilahpieh bangin, amauh ka bawthop dinga, alungtang tuomtu anahgute uh ka bawttel ding a, khunah humpibahnei bangin amauh ka negam ding hi. Gamsain abawtel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Israel suhsiet na hita, hinanleh nangma panpina khu Keima a kipan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei na leengpa ka hi dinga, na khopi zousie a hing hundam dingin, leengpa dang hei ah a um ei? “Leng leh vaihawmtu hing pie in na china uh,” tuin hei a um atai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lungthah pum in leengpa ka hing pie a, ka thangpaina ziehin ama ka lamangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephraim thulimlouna tunkhawm in a um a, akhelna kholkhawm in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Numei nauvei gimthuohna atungah atung dinga, ama tapa pillou ahi a; tate piendohna mun a aum den ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hankhuh silbawltheina apat in amaute ka tankhe dinga, shina akipat in amaute ka tankhe ding hi. Aw shina na gawtna ka hi ding a, Aw hankhuh na manthaina ka hi ding hi. Ka mit apat hepina akiselmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ephraim asanggamte lah ah ga pha mananleh, suolam huipi ahing laang dinga; Mangpa huipi gamdai apat in ahing laang tou ding hi. Tuachi’n atuinah ahing gaw dinga, tualeh atuikhuh zong akang ding hi. Agou koina akilu dinga, agou deihuoi manpha teng akipomang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samaria in akhelna akikhuh ding hi, Aziehpen amanu a Pasian tungah ahel hi. Amaute namsau in ashi ding ua, atangehte uh tuoltang satna’n akinei ding hi. Tualeh anumei gailaite uh gil akikhuo pieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel Mangpa na Pasian kungah kinuale kia in. Na thulimlouna zieh in na kipalpuata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thute hing keng inlen, Mangpa kungah hing kile kia inlen, Ama kungah, Ka khelnate zousie uh lamang inlen, khotuona toh hing na sangin, ka muh kithoinate uh ka hing lan ding uhi, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assiria in ahing hundam sih dinga, sakolte tungah ka tuong sih ding ua, ka khutsuohte u’kungah zong, noute ka pasiente uh na hi uh, ka chi nawn sih ding uhi.” Aziehpen pa neilouten Nangma ah khotuona amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima’n anuatolna uh ka damsah dinga, Amauh manbei in ka it ding hi. Aziehpen ka lungthahna amaute apat akiheimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel a dingin daitui bang ka hi dinga, Ama zong lili bangin apoudoh ding a, Lebanon muol a singkungte bangin, ahui ahadoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abate azamdal dinga akilawmnate khu, Olive sing bang ahi dinga, agimnamtui khu Lebanon abang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lim nuoi a tengte ahing kinuale kia ding ua, Bu tang bangin ahing hingdoh kia ding ua, grepgui bangin akhangdoh ding ua, tualeh agimtui khu Lebanon uoin bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim in, milimte tungah bang ahiei ka bawl nahlai ding? achi dinga, Ken ka zata a, amauh ka khotuo ding hi; Kei theipi sing hing bang ka hi a, keima apat in na ga uh akimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Koi ahiei mipil? Aman tam silte theisiem heh. Koi ahiei theikah siemna nei? Aman amauh theisiem hen. Aziehpen Mangpa lampite adih a; midihtatten azui ding uhi. Hinanleh akheltat a palsante akipalpua ding uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
